From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] luma: the shelf spec's status grid, dock, menus and live extension options

The status grid is six fixed slots in the spec's order; a slot whose thing
is off draws at 35%, and a red dot on the microphone marks recording that
the Well couldn't attribute. Lucide glyphs for the slots are outlined for
symbolic recolouring. Dock icons lift 2px on hover and dim to 92% when
pressed, sit full-bleed at radius 10, and name themselves in a 24px
tooltip 8px above the island. Every shelf menu opens 8px beyond its island
on the menu surface. A live extension opens its app on click and its
options on right-click. The date tile keeps the calendar's blue on the
light treatments.

